    <grid>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "name": "1 column layout",
  "sections": [
    {
      "grid": "12",
      "rows": [
        {
          "name": "Article Full",
          "id": "309e2d4b-2d7d-4f87-ba89-b73f65ff57bf",
          "areas": [
            {
              "grid": "12",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": "<div class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"758bl\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\">\n<div class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\">\n<p><br />With the expansion of Roadlab's concrete testing capacity in East London, we've cemented our position as the most equipped concrete laboratory in the Eastern Cape.</p>\n<p><strong>Take a closer look at our new concrete durability department and the concrete tests we offer.</strong></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": {
                    "focalPoint": {
                      "left": 0.5,
                      "top": 0.5
                    },
                    "id": 2048,
                    "udi": "umb://media/849ab658ce5e484491a2bcf51691a53a",
                    "image": "/media/l01jvbc4/vlcsnap-2020-02-13-16h18m52s927.png"
                  },
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "media",
                    "view": "media"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            }
          ],
          "styles": null,
          "config": null
        },
        {
          "name": "Article Full",
          "id": "3b96bd4b-e7fa-4161-89eb-ab21553639be",
          "areas": [
            {
              "grid": "12",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": "<hr />\n<p> </p>\n<p><span class=\"heading-h3\">Durability Testing<br /></span></p>\n<p>We are East London's only nationally-supported provider of quality concrete durability testing.</p>\n<p><strong>D</strong><strong>urability testing reveals how well protected your concrete and rebar is from the elements and environmental factors that threaten the long-term integrity of your structures.</strong></p>\n<p>Our concrete durability testing comprises of three test methods focusing on critical aspects of durability.</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Oxygen permeability</strong>, by which we expose concrete samples to pressurised oxygen to test how much oxygen is penetrating into your structures.</li>\n<li><strong>Water </strong><span class=\"ILfuVd\"><span class=\"hgKElc\"><strong>sorptivity</strong>, by which we measure concrete's ability to absorb and transmit water and resist exposure to aggressive environments.</span></span></li>\n<li><strong>Chloride conductivity</strong>, by which we measure<span class=\"hgKElc\"> the intrinsic potential of concrete or mortar to resist the ingress of chlorides by diffusion.</span></li>\n</ol>\n<p> </p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": {
                    "focalPoint": {
                      "left": 0.5,
                      "top": 0.5
                    },
                    "id": 2047,
                    "udi": "umb://media/40c07b59bcbe4672afc22486a3fe0234",
                    "image": "/media/l33naqf4/concrete-durabilities.jpg"
                  },
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "media",
                    "view": "media"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            }
          ],
          "styles": null,
          "config": null
        },
        {
          "name": "Article Full",
          "id": "a4dd53a1-6d2d-4134-98db-e41b08ea6829",
          "areas": [
            {
              "grid": "12",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": "<hr />\n<p> </p>\n<p><span class=\"heading-h3\">Strength Testing<br /></span></p>\n<p>Our bread and butter, the most common and critical aspects of concrete quality control.</p>\n<p><strong>By exposing concrete cores or hardened samples to compressive and flexural stress, we can determine the strength of the structures that concrete will one day form part of.</strong></p>\n<p>Our concrete durability testing comprises of three test methods focusing on critical aspects of durability.</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Compressive strength</strong>, by means of a concrete cube press.</li>\n<li><strong>Flexural strength</strong><span class=\"hgKElc\">, by means of a concrete beam press. <br /></span></li>\n<li><strong>Tensile strength, </strong>by means of a concrete beam press fitted with a novel tensile test jig.</li>\n<li><strong>Aggregate Crushing Value</strong>, by which we determine the particle strength of aggregate for use in concrete.</li>\n<li><strong>10% Fines Aggregate Crushing Test</strong>, by which we determine <span class=\"hgKElc\"> the force required to crush a prepared aggregate sample such that 10% of the material passes a specified sieve.</span><span class=\"hgKElc\"></span></li>\n</ol>\n<p> </p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": {
                    "focalPoint": {
                      "left": 0.5,
                      "top": 0.5
                    },
                    "id": 2049,
                    "udi": "umb://media/6867cf48b39c433d91278d7193a0c9a8",
                    "image": "/media/j1hho0e2/vlcsnap-2020-02-13-16h17m29s208.png"
                  },
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "media",
                    "view": "media"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            }
          ],
          "styles": null,
          "config": null
        },
        {
          "name": "Article Full",
          "id": "803c30ed-201a-471d-8e28-996b498ee370",
          "areas": [
            {
              "grid": "12",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": "<hr />\n<p> </p>\n<p><span class=\"heading-h3\">Concrete Mix Designs<br /></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"ILfuVd\"><span class=\"hgKElc\">The perfect marriage of cement, sand and aggregates. </span></span><span class=\"ILfuVd\"><span class=\"hgKElc\"></span></span></p>\n<p><strong>Our concrete mix designs draw on our decades of experience in every aspect of high-quality mix design, allowing you to mix, pour and build with confidence.  </strong></p>\n<p>Our testing for concrete mix designs focuses on all critical aspects of concrete mixes, including but not limited to the following:</p>\n<p><strong>Stone</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Loose Bulk Density</li>\n<li>Compacted Bulk Density</li>\n<li>Aggregate Grading</li>\n<li>Bulk Relative Density &gt;5mm</li>\n<li>Flakiness Index</li>\n<li>Water absorption</li>\n<li>Specific Gravity</li>\n<li>Aggregate Crushing Value</li>\n<li>10% Fines Aggregate Crushing Value</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Sand</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Organic Impurities</li>\n<li>Aggregate Grading</li>\n<li>Loose Bulk Density</li>\n<li>Compacted Bulk Density</li>\n<li>Bulk Density &gt;5mm</li>\n<li>Specific Gravity</li>\n<li>Aggregate Crushing Value</li>\n<li>10% Fines Aggregate Crushing Value</li>\n</ol>\n<p> </p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": {
                    "focalPoint": {
                      "left": 0.5,
                      "top": 0.5
                    },
                    "id": 2083,
                    "udi": "umb://media/0c6bc5acdfd1438a81214ea55a4c83a3",
                    "image": "/media/vlchwdgr/vlcsnap-2020-02-13-16h37m19s858.png"
                  },
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "media",
                    "view": "media"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            }
          ],
          "styles": null,
          "config": null
        },
        {
          "name": "Article Full",
          "id": "f695f4fd-0e3c-4d11-8624-d34f2df13458",
          "areas": [
            {
              "grid": "12",
              "controls": [
                {
                  "value": "<hr />\n<p> </p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                },
                {
                  "value": "<p><span class=\"heading-h3\">Our dedicated concrete technologists and operations teams in the Eastern Cape are ready to answer your questions. </span></p>\n<p><span class=\"heading-h3\">Reach out to us today.</span></p>",
                  "editor": {
                    "alias": "rte",
                    "view": "rte"
                  },
                  "styles": null,
                  "config": null
                }
              ],
              "styles": null,
              "config": null
            }
          ],
          "styles": null,
          "config": null
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}]]></Value>
